The game and its assets
-----------------------
tPoseidon is an independent, fan-made server emulator. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by or connected to the owners of the game it works with.

The game, its client, executables, libraries, art, music, sound, maps, data
tables, names and trademarks belong to their respective owners. None of them
are included in this repository or in the tPoseidon release packages, and
none of them are covered by the tPoseidon license. Players and server hosts
must supply their own copy of the game client. At run time, tPoseidon reads
the game data it needs from the folder of the client the user points it to.

